        "sid": "1SA 27"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "27",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi iri baraá muunaáwós i oó', «Ís baalarkaaro Saulo án i gaas. Gár tsiní dir'eene an goów amór yaamaá múk Filisti. Saulo bira leelehhahhiít baraá guruú yaamuukaá Israeliro iqo mune sii', adoorihe daqaní aníng a /úw Saulowo.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adorihe, Daudi nee mukós kuduú tsiire lahhoó' tana tláy ar gaanslaay, tari hardáh amór Akishi garmoó Maoki, waawutmoó yaamaá Gati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi nee múk do'ose tana alhoót nee Akishi amoodár Gatír wa ale. Daudi tlaawaay ngu kon a tsár, Ahinoamu tidár Yesre'eli nee Abigaili kwaalo'oodár Nabali ar yaamaá Karmeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ngiwa axaás adór Daudi ira goów ay Gati, Saulo aa sangw leelehhtuú Daudi ki/iiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalarka wake, Daudi Akishi guri báy, «Aníng bira ya/aán, qawáng gixsár wake baraá yaamuuwoge as kahhó' dír hotaangw ngiwa slaw. Gár án nee kuúng tas alhootaan i káhh baraá gixsár waawutmoó wa ale.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baalaarihe, waawutmo Akishi Daudi guri qáy ar gixsár ta bay Siklagi. Gawaá adoorihe iimír baalaadá' gixsár Siklagi waawutmoó Yuda gari sláy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi afiqooma ngaa hoót baraá yaamaá múk Filistiro a kuru wak nee slahheeraá tsiyáhh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá afiqoomaadae Daudi nee mukós tana slaqwarár áy amór múk Geshuri, nee múk Girisi nee múk Amaleki. Inooín an yaamuloouusér yaamuudá' iimír aange. Giri haraadáh baraá yaamuuínií ale, ay yaamaá múk Shuri, kudaá digma nee yaamaá Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ayeemoodá' gina haraadáh ar slaqwara, tam heé aa geexáy i kaahh, hhawaate nee /ameenaaro, hikwa nee daqwaaye, nee angamía, bee/aangw nee tlabaawo, iri kií/ amór Akishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akishi Daudi guri báy, «Laarí nee múk bartá amá aga slaqwe'?» Daudi iri oó', «A yaamaá Negebúr Yuda,» laqaá «Negebúr Yerame'eli,» laqaá «Negebúr múk Keni.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi tam hee gwa slafiíngwí geexayká hhawaate nee /ameenaaro, as ngiwa huwi ay Gati, ina baraá muunaáwósi oó', «Kangwíng aluuwo kungu daandemoorén i oo', tawa ooi, ‹Daudi kángw aa /imiís a kwí nee kuqá'.› » Gawaá adoorihe, adoorí tay dawa dír Daudiwo qoomár yaamaá múk Filisti ngiwa hoót. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akishi, Daudi guri gurií baá/, inós ngiwa xui Daudi kwaa sií' nee múk Israeli, iri baraá muunaáwós i oó', «Daxta án in sagadiyuus baraá hotangw'eé' sleémeero.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
